# Civil Society

**Authors:** Edyta B. Pietrzak

## Abstract
The EU provides financial support to Civil Society in Vietnam through its thematic programmes: (1) The European Instrument for Democracy and Human Rights (EIDHR); (2) the Civil Society Organizations and Local Authorities Thematic Progra mmes (CSO-LA) and (3) Environment and Sustainable Natural Resource Management, including Energy. Several Calls for Proposals under the framework of these thematic programmes have bee n launched since 2008 for actions in Vietnam, resulting to date 48 grants awarded with a ot l funding of over €16.5 million in the areas of human rights, good governance, healthcare, l bour, community development, child protection, water and sanitation and sustainable co nsumption and production.

